  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Camille feels horribly guilty about Mathias being hospitalized after their intense confrontation. To help distract her, Herve plays a board game with her in the agency office. Let's listen to their conversation in French first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "herve",
      "t": "Ça va?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lea",
      "t": "Je suis dévastée.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "herve",
      "t": "C'est pour nous.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lea",
      "t": "Je me déteste quand je suis comme ça.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "herve",
      "t": "Qu'est-ce qui t'arrive?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lea",
      "t": "C'est papa...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lea",
      "t": "C'est ma faute s'il est à l'hôpital.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lea",
      "t": "Je l'ai presque tué!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "herve",
      "t": "C'est faux!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "herve",
      "t": "Tout le monde a failli tuer ton père.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "herve",
      "t": "Il a l'habitude.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "herve",
      "t": "Tu viens d'appeler Mathias 'papa'.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lea",
      "t": "Un, deux, trois, quatre...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "herve",
      "t": "Tu récupères l'argent.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's walk through it.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "herve",
      "t": "Ça va?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you okay?' Herve asks his friend gently.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lea",
      "t": "Je suis dévastée.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am devastated.' Camille admits, looking very sad.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "herve",
      "t": "C'est pour nous.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is for us.' Herve says, trying to cheer her up.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lea",
      "t": "Je me déteste quand je suis comme ça.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I hate myself when I am like this.' Camille sighs in distress.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "herve",
      "t": "Qu'est-ce qui t'arrive?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What is wrong with you?' Herve asks, confused.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lea",
      "t": "C'est papa...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is dad...' Camille blurts out tearfully.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lea",
      "t": "C'est ma faute s'il est à l'hôpital.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is my fault if he is in the hospital.' Camille confesses her deep guilt.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lea",
      "t": "Je l'ai presque tué!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I almost killed him!' Camille cries with anguish.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "herve",
      "t": "C'est faux!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That is false!' Herve tells her firmly.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "herve",
      "t": "Tout le monde a failli tuer ton père.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone has almost killed your father.' Herve jokes to reassure her.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "herve",
      "t": "Il a l'habitude.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He is used to it.' Herve adds with a reassuring smile.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "herve",
      "t": "Tu viens d'appeler Mathias 'papa'.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You just called Mathias 'dad'.' Herve points out in surprise.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lea",
      "t": "Un, deux, trois, quatre...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'One, two, three, four...' Camille counts out the board game moves.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "herve",
      "t": "Tu récupères l'argent.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You get the money.' Herve explains the game rules. Now let's hear the whole thing.",
      "gap": 0.9
